span></h2>\n<ul><li>Woodmill Inc. Pre-Alpha lasted from 7/20/21 until 8/16/21, where only 1000 people bought access.</li>\n<li>Due to how few people bought access and how long it has been, this item and the <a href=\"/wiki/Very_Light_Envelope\" title=\"Very Light Envelope\">Edward Statue</a> are the current rarest items in the game, with an estimation of ~50 people who are still around since then.</li>\n<li>Some people recognize the music played as the Menu/Daytime music from a game called <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://treelands.fandom.com/wiki/TreeLands_Wiki\">Treelands</a> developed by New Fissy another game that took inspiration from Lumber Tycoon.</li>\n<li>The item is unusual as initially the item spawns as a small crate-like object. Opening it then reveals the Gift of Melancholic Memories.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902191916\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 432/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019523/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.207      1 -total\n 96.22%   40.612      1 Template:Objects\n  3.60%    1.518      1 Template:Trade-only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:433-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902191916 and revision id 7417. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Gifts","Exclusive"],"links":[{"title":"Very Light Envelope","exists":true}],"images":["Unboxed_gift.png","Gift_of_Melancholic_Memories.pn